  "summary": {
    "none": [
      "Orange t-shirt short-sleeved t-shirt with multicolor silkscreen on front and back. Front of t-shirt: portrait of Barack Obama superimposed on flag of Kenya with \"Obama '08\" in white lettering below. Back of t-shirt: \"Ndio tunaweza\" (translation: yes we can) in Swahili black capital lettering on two lines."
    ]
  },
